00:06:39.615 --> 00:06:43.648
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:44.247 --> 00:06:50.055
<v Slow>コビトカバの赤ちゃんは、いつ生まれましたか。

00:06:50.855 --> 00:06:52.800
<v Host>On August eleventh.

00:06:53.399 --> 00:06:58.007
<v Slow>お母さんの名前は、何ですか。

00:06:58.807 --> 00:07:02.600
<v Host>Her name is Koyuri — she is seventeen years old.

00:07:03.199 --> 00:07:08.384
<v Slow>今、赤ちゃんを見ることができますか。

00:07:09.184 --> 00:07:17.103
<v Host>Not yet. The mother and baby are in a quiet place inside a building, and the zoo will announce when visitors can see them.

00:07:17.704 --> 00:07:28.432
<v Host>That's all for today. One of the rarest animals on Earth has a brand-new baby in Nagoya. Here's hoping the little one grows up big and strong. See you tomorrow!

00:07:29.031 --> 00:07:31.432
<v News>また明日。
